# AI agent configuration
# AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are the project's agent ruleset and ARE committed —
# they call themselves canonical, and for nineteen months they were ignored, so
# every rule and every correction written into them lived on one machine and
# reached no clone, no CI and no reviewer.
# `.agents/` stays ignored on purpose: it holds machine-local overrides and
# paths, which must not follow the repo to another machine.
